## 2. 3-Day Preparation Schedule

**Total Watching Time:** ~4 Hours 30 Minutes  
**Remaining Time:** Practical hands-on practice in Excel/Google Sheets.

### Day 1: Advanced Excel & MIS Core
* **Watch (1 hr 20 mins):**
  * *Excel Formulas & Functions* (Kevin Stratvert) — **35 mins**
  * *MIS Executive Course* (Skills Improvement) — **45 mins**
* **Practice (2.5 hrs):**
  * Open Excel and create sample datasets. Practice writing nested `IF`, `XLOOKUP`, `INDEX-MATCH`, `SUMIFS`, and `TEXTJOIN`.
  * Practice creating Pivot Tables, calculated fields, and conditional formatting rules.

---

### Day 2: WFM Concepts, Metrics & NICE IEX
* **Watch (1 hr 10 mins):**
  * *Basics on WFM* (Call Center WFM) — **18 mins**
  * *Manage Shrinkage & SLA* (WFM Tipsy Thursdays) — **14 mins**
  * *NICE WFM Simulation & Engagement* (NICE Official) — **6 mins**
  * *MIS & WFM Interview Q&A* (Career with Omkar) — **22 mins**
* **Practice (2.5 hrs):**
  * Calculate key metrics manually in Excel using formulas:
    $$\text{Shrinkage \%} = \frac{\text{Total Non-Productive Hours}}{\text{Total Paid Hours}} \times 100$$
    $$\text{Occupancy \%} = \frac{\text{Total Handle Time}}{\text{Logged-in Time} - \text{Shrinkage}} \times 100$$
  * Solve scenario questions (e.g., *How do you handle a sudden 20% spike in call volume during an intraday shift?*).

---

### Day 3: Dashboards (Looker Studio, Power BI, Tableau) & Final Review
* **Watch (1 hr 00 min):**
  * *Looker Studio Quick-Start* (Loves Data) — **10 mins**
  * *Power BI Tutorial* (Kevin Stratvert) — **10 mins**
  * *Tableau in 10 Mins* (Edureka) — **11 mins**
  * Re-watch specific problem areas or backup videos as needed — **25 mins**
* **Practice (2 hrs):**
  * Connect a Google Sheet to Looker Studio and build a 1-page interactive dashboard (Scorecards, Bar Chart, Date Filter).
  * Review all key formulas, WFM terms (Adherence vs Conformance), and mock interview responses.
